==English==

===Etymology===
The term "Shoot the Shit" came from the American Old West.  When Fathers would teach their sons to shoot.  Not having ample ammunition to spare for practice.  Fathers would fabricate wooden pistols with hollowed out barrels to allow for a sharpen stick, or pea, or pepple to be loaded in to.  The the children were instructed to use cow pattys as targets.  When the child could master "shooting the shit" they would graduate to a real pistol with live ammunition.  

This led to boys standing around cow pattys "shooting the shit" and gossiping about whatever.  So the term was morphed to mean gossiping or chatting for the modern world. 

If you watch early Western Movies, usually in black amd white. You can see how the old timers shoot with a pointing style.  This is different from a modern shooters technique.

